st.\nThe reason for this is their high mentality towards devotion. In a way,\nif seen, there is no desire for lust in the divine realm, and if it ever happens, then conception does not occur. But in the world of the earth, conception happens, even if people try very hard to avoid offspring. In this\nsinful Kali Yuga, humans have started infanticide even in the womb. This is a very low deed, from this the doer\nonly increases in material sufferings."
